101 PALASM HELP  
101     Command line format to invoke MINIMIZE:
101	  
101     MINIMIZE [OPTION ...]
101	  
101     OPTIONs: 
101       -log [<logfile[.log]>]  capture screen messages to disk file.
101       -help print out help screen.
101       -?    print out help screen.
101       -1eqn read one equation at a time from tre file.
101       -tre [trefile[.ext]] input and output tre file
101       -xor  xor processing.
101       -p <number>  or-gate splitting.
101       -a  conforming to device polarity (non-programmable polarity device)
101       -ao best polarity selection (programmable polarity device). 
101       -ah active high polarity selection (programmable polarity device).
101       -al active low polarity selection (programmable polarity device).
101       -dt optimization of d & t register logic.
101       -d  conversion to d register logic.
101       -t  conversion to t register logic.
101       -efast  fast minimization (faster but not optimal).
101    
